# AI-friendly declarative game
project "AI Adventure"
version "1.0"
map 1200 700
start main

node town 120 340 "Town"
node forest 520 260 "Forest"
connect town forest
entity hero town

scene main
  background_color "24,24,32"
  say hero "We should go."
  choice "Go to the forest" -> forest

scene forest
  say hero "We made it."
